   "title": "Princess's Campus Romance~",
   "description": "Description:\n\nThe Last Thing She ever wanted To Look For in her New Life was Romance but Fate had other plans. \n              When Rheva Johnson Was \"Punished\" for her deeds, she lost Everything and ended up entangling herself with the Two Powerful Groups In her New College.\n\nThe Group of Elites, they were perfect in everything but Unexpectedly Rheva Johnson Pushed the Top Scholars of the group down to Second and third position respectively because of her Crazy brain.\n\nNow what?? The Two groups which are always at their neck Finally Lost Against an \"Orphan\". \nWill their so called pride let them move on or more chaos will come?? \nRheva Johnson wanted peace but these Group of elites had some Different plans for her.\nShe lost not only her peace but her heart as well.\nTheir was No going Back— It's either she Stay as calm as Possible or ruin Them mercilessly.\n\nHer heart which was freezing every passing day finally Found a little spark, will she accept it ??\n\nTo Know More Read the Story.\n\nMangaToon got authorization from N.. to publish this work, the content is the author's own point of view, and does not represent the stand of MangaToon.",
