   "title": "Infectious . |Mangatoon Romance |",
   "description": "[ Beautiful Assassin x Mafia Lord ]\n\nAttending the only mafia college in the world where only the mafia, wealthy, and billion dollar parents children attend. Labeled and placed in the highest position depending on who their parents are. \n\nLittle did they know they three daughters of a powerful assassin/mafia family are coming to the territory and one of them are gonna catch the attention of the most powerful man in the mafia/underworld. \n\n. \n.\n\n𝐔𝐫𝐢𝐱𝐞𝐥𝐥𝐢𝐚   𝐅𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐞\n\nA beautiful and deadly but ruthless assassin female that takes no disrespect from anyone. And she is the first born granddaughter to the French mafia lord and the first ever Russian female in the underground. \n\n\n𝐊𝐚𝐳𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐫    𝐌𝐨𝐫𝐨𝐳𝐨𝐯\n\nThe handsome Russian mafia lord that rules the mafia and underworld with an iron fist. A cold gaze but a intimidating and ruthless reputation for torturing his enemies and striking fear into his rivals. \n\n.\n.\n\n𝐖𝐡𝐞𝐧 𝐡𝐞 𝐬𝐞𝐭 𝐡𝐢𝐬 𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐡𝐭𝐬 𝐨𝐧 𝐡𝐞𝐫 𝐡𝐞 𝐝𝐞𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐝 𝐡𝐞𝐫 𝐚𝐬 𝐡𝐢𝐬 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐰𝐨𝐫𝐭𝐡𝐲 𝐨𝐟 𝐡𝐢𝐬 𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐞. 𝐀𝐧𝐝 𝐚𝐧𝐲𝐨𝐧𝐞 𝐭𝐡𝐚𝐭 𝐭𝐫𝐢𝐞𝐬 𝐭𝐨 𝐜𝐡𝐚𝐧𝐠𝐞 𝐭𝐡𝐚𝐭 𝐰𝐢𝐥𝐥 𝐥𝐨𝐨𝐬𝐞 𝐭𝐡𝐞𝐢𝐫 𝐥𝐢𝐟𝐞.\n\nMangaToon got authorization from xClassyAmore to publish this work, the content is the author's own point of view, and does not represent the stand of MangaToon.",
